    {
      "id": "claim_7bc38db5c70144588827563cdd41eafa",
      "statement": "A graph level with no declared rules is never built at all, since judging NestJS requires booting containers and judging TypeScript requires building a ts.Program, so a workspace declaring only Nx rules pays for neither.",
